---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  sectionPlaceholder
  title="About | Atlas Aeterna"
  description="Learn about Atlas Aeterna, a growing collection exploring history, geography, mysteries and the stories that connect them."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="about-content">
      <header class="about-intro">
        <svg class="about-atlas" viewBox="0 0 480 405" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="about-atlas-ink" x1="95" y1="408" x2="407" y2="16" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <stop offset=".04" stop-color="#8d9fc6" stop-opacity="0" />
              <stop offset=".26" stop-color="#8d9fc6" stop-opacity=".14" />
              <stop offset=".61" stop-color="#8294c1" stop-opacity=".44" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#7489bb" stop-opacity=".71" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <g stroke="url(#about-atlas-ink)" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M20 401C34 280 114 166 214 91C290 34 375 5 480 2" />
            <path d="M65 403C78 294 138 184 222 106C291 42 386 10 480 2" />
            <path d="M139 404C146 287 192 172 264 93C319 34 394 11 480 2" />
            <path d="M228 405C232 293 263 183 320 103C366 40 419 13 480 2" />
            <path d="M331 405C333 296 351 194 387 117C417 55 447 20 480 2" />
            <path d="M434 405C433 301 444 177 465 76C471 48 476 22 480 2" />
            <path d="M323 32C315 43 370 56 480 59M224 84C204 96 254 118 327 128C373 135 424 138 480 138M136 162C108 179 158 205 242 223C313 238 399 247 480 248M70 262C50 282 92 308 177 328C258 347 377 355 480 355" />
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
          <h1>About Atlas Aeterna</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Atlas Aeterna is an independent project built around a curiosity for history, geography,
            mysteries and the countless stories found between them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <article class="pillar">
          <svg class="pillar-icon" viewBox="0 0 106 65" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="32.5" cy="32.5" r="28" stroke-width="1.13" />
              <circle cx="32.5" cy="32.5" r="25.4" stroke-width=".65" opacity=".4" />
              <path d="M32.5 8.5v5m0 38v5m24-24h-5m-38 0h-5M20.5 11.7l2.2 3.8m19.6 34 2.2 3.8m8.8-32.8-3.8 2.2m-34 19.6-3.8 2.2m32.8-32.8-2.2 3.8m-19.6 34-2.2 3.8m32.8-8.8-3.8-2.2m-34-19.6-3.8-2.2" stroke-width=".92" opacity=".86" />
              <path d="m32.5 32.5 14-12.4m-14 12.4-8.9-6.1" stroke-width="1.36" />
              <circle cx="32.5" cy="32.5" r="1.65" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
            </g>
          </svg>
          <h2>Explore the Past</h2>
          <p>
            From the rise and fall of empires to forgotten events and extraordinary lives, this
            section explores the stories that shaped the past and the traces they have left on the present.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar">
          <svg class="pillar-icon" viewBox="0 0 106 65" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.04" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M3 40c10 0 13-12 25-14 13-2 19-5 28-15C65 1 78 7 85 17c6 9 10 13 18 15" opacity=".7" />
              <path d="M2 46c13 0 16-11 27-14 11-3 19-3 27-12C65 8 74 11 82 22c6 9 13 14 20 14" opacity=".76" />
              <path d="M3 52c13-4 17-9 28-12 10-3 21-4 30-15 5-6 12-7 18 0 5 5 8 13 20 15" opacity=".83" />
              <path d="M4 56c14-5 24-9 35-5 11 4 18 2 29-2 9-3 15-2 23 3 7 4 12 1 12-4 0-5-6-8-13-9-9-2-12-8-18-10-8-3-12 6-20 11-6 4-13 4-21 5" />
              <path d="M47 45c7-2 14-8 21-10 5-2 8 2 13 5 4 2 10 3 12 5 4 4-1 6-6 3-8-4-15-5-23-2-6 2-12 5-17-1Z" opacity=".85" />
              <path d="M60 42c4-3 8-5 12-5 3 0 4 2 6 3-7 0-12 2-18 2Z" opacity=".61" />
              <path d="M10 59c10-3 19-5 26-2 14 6 22 2 33-2 7-2 13-3 22 2 5 3 9 2 12-2" opacity=".63" />
            </g>
          </svg>
          <h2>Discover the World</h2>
          <p>
            Geography is more than borders and place names. This section explores countries,
            landscapes, cultures and the natural forces that have shaped both human history and
            the world around us.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar">
          <svg class="pillar-icon" viewBox="0 0 106 65" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 53c16-6 23-25 36-25 15 0 20 22 32 21 11-1 12-17 22-21" stroke-width="1.38" stroke-dasharray="3.2 3.6" />
              <path d="m5 53 4.2-4.4m-4.2 4.4 6.3-1.8" stroke-width="1.15" />
              <path d="M101 16c0 4.1-5.2 10.6-5.2 10.6S90.6 20.1 90.6 16a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 10.4 0Z" stroke-width="1.38" />
            </g>
          </svg>
          <h2>Question the Unknown</h2>
          <p>
            From lost cities and ancient legends to unexplained events and enduring mysteries, this
            section explores the stories that exist somewhere between history, possibility and myth.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
        <div class="mission-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The idea</p>
          <h2 id="mission-title">A place built for curiosity.</h2>
          <p>
            Atlas Aeterna is a growing home for history, geography and mysteries, bringing together
            stories, research and ideas that might otherwise be scattered across countless sources.
            The aim is to make fascinating subjects easier to explore in depth.
          </p>
          <p>
            As the project grows, so too will its collection of stories, places and unanswered questions.
          </p>
          <div class="social-links" role="group" aria-label="Atlas Aeterna on social media">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@AtlasAeterna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              YouTube
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M4 12 12 4m-6 0h6v6" />
              </svg>
              <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@atlasaeterna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              TikTok
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M4 12 12 4m-6 0h6v6" />
              </svg>
              <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    inline-size: 100%;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .about-content {
    inline-size: min(92%, 82.5rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block-end: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.25rem);
  }

  .about-intro {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 10.25rem) clamp(0.5rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem)
      clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .intro-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-intro .about-atlas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto auto 67%;
    z-index: 0;
    display: block;
    inline-size: clamp(28rem, 47vw, 50rem);
    max-inline-size: none;
    block-size: auto;
    color: #8f9bd4;
    opacity: 0.51;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #424d76;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(0.74rem, 1.13vw, 0.98rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.125em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #141724;
    font-weight: 400;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  h1 {
    max-inline-size: 73rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.4vw, 5rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.018em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .lead {
    max-inline-size: 65ch;
    margin: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem) 0 0;
    color: #33394d;
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.8vw, 1.43rem);
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .about-grid {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.9rem, 1.7vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .pillar {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    align-content: start;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    border: 1px solid #ffffffb8;
    border-radius: clamp(0.95rem, 1.65vw, 1.45rem);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff59, #fcfaff37 62%, #f1eff925);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px #8192bc25,
      0 8px 26px #35417008;
  }

  .pillar::before {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8px 19% auto 8%;
    block-size: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #fff 18%, #fff9 55%, transparent);
    content: "";
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .pillar .pillar-icon {
    display: block;
    inline-size: min(100%, 7.5rem);
    block-size: 3.45rem;
    color: #546a96;
  }

  .pillar h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.34vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .pillar p,
  .mission-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0;
    color: #33394d;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.32vw, 1.13rem);
    line-height: 1.64;
  }

  .mission {
    margin: clamp(3.25rem, 7.5vw, 7rem) clamp(0.5rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem) 0;
    padding-block-start: clamp(2.15rem, 5vw, 4.25rem);
    border-block-start: 1px solid #838fb850;
  }

  .mission-copy {
    max-inline-size: 55rem;
  }

  .mission h2 {
    margin-block-end: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.94rem, 3.9vw, 3.3rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.13;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .mission-copy > p + p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-block-start: 1.2em;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.45rem;
  }

  .social-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.48em;
    min-block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0.45rem 1.05rem;
    border: 1px solid #ffffffbd;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff78, #fbf9ff43);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #8192bc29;
    color: #27314c;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-underline-offset: 0.22em;
  }

  .social-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .social-links svg {
    inline-size: 0.9em;
    block-size: 0.9em;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    inline-size: 1px;
    block-size: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-content { inline-size: min(92%, 43rem); }

    .about-intro {
      padding-block: clamp(3.6rem, 11vw, 5.5rem) clamp(2.7rem, 9vw, 4.2rem);
    }

    .about-intro .about-atlas {
      inset-inline-start: 70%;
      inline-size: clamp(17rem, 54vw, 31rem);
      opacity: 0.36;
    }

    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

    .pillar {
      grid-template-rows: none;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .pillar h2 { font-size: clamp(1.48rem, 4.2vw, 1.96rem); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .about-content { inline-size: calc(100% - 1.75rem); }
    .about-intro, .mission { padding-inline: 0.2rem; }
    .mission { margin-inline: 0; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 10vw, 2.6rem); }
  }
</style>
